# Dashboard UI

- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only for charts, tables, ticker, React Query.
- Icons: `lucide-react` (`ArrowUpRight`, `ArrowDownRight`).
- Charts: `recharts` via `PriceChart` wrapper — do not inline AreaChart elsewhere.
- KPI display → `MetricCard`; grids → `WatchlistTable`; top bar → `TickerTape`.
- Fetch with shared hooks (`useQuotes`, `useCrypto`, `useFx`) — `refetchInterval: 15_000`.
- Use `cn()`; shadcn primitives live in `components/ui/`.
- One concern per component file; extract when JSX > ~80 lines.
